const prompt="Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: production raster sprite atlas for Тиходол city-builder. Style reference is the user's simple flat olive/ochre/cream game world. Exactly 4 columns x 2 rows, eight isolated objects centered in equal cells with generous margins and no grid lines. Row1: four DIFFERENT small natural edible berry bushes, muted olive leafy crowns with a few clearly visible small RED berry dots: irregular wide bush, three-lobed bush, compact rounded bush, two connected leafy masses. Tiny short brown stems, irregular silhouettes. Row2 cell1: berry gatherers' small OPEN work yard, ochre woven awning on four wooden posts, two berry baskets and sorting table, no generic closed house and no signs; cell2: tiny worker in cream tunic olive hat, idle; cell3: same worker carrying a small basket full of red berries; cell4: clear resource icon of a small bunch of three red berries with two olive leaves. CRITICAL CAMERA: orthographic almost directly above, 15 degrees from VERTICAL, straight from front with no side rotation, no perspective narrowing. Tops dominate, short front surfaces. Light from upper RIGHT, shadow lower LEFT, only small crisp flat contact shadows. Flat matte simple color shapes, muted earthy palette, no gradients no noise no glowing halos no blurred edges no text no labels no presentation background. Opaque object interiors, truly empty transparent background. Make bushes organic and distinct, small compared with houses, workers scaled consistently, all sprites entirely within own cell. Final reusable PNG for later animation.";
store("berryprompt",prompt);const r=await tools.image_gen__imagegen({prompt,referenced_image_paths:["/home/suselman/projects/hearthvale/docs/references/style-world.jpg"],transparent_background:true});store("berrygen",r);if(r.output_hint)text(r.output_hint);

